What the C actually is: a vendored copy of [38;5;10mstb_ds.h[0m (dynamic arrays + open-addressing hash map with siphash) plus two test helpers at the bottom — [38;5;10mstrkey[0m and [38;5;10marr_del[0m, the only function declared in [38;5;10minclude/lib.h[0m. There are no namespace-renaming macros; the [38;5;10m#define arrpush stbds_arrput[0m family only renames macros, so linker symbols are unchanged.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
Fidelity points worth calling out:[0m[0m
[0m[0m
- The C integer-promotion quirk in [38;5;10mstbds_siphash_bytes[0m is reproduced, not fixed. [38;5;10md[3] << 24[0m is an [38;5;10mint[0m expression, so a byte ≥ 0x80 makes it negative and it sign-extends when assigned to [38;5;10msize_t[0m, setting the whole upper half of [38;5;10mdata[0m. I kept that ([38;5;10m(x as c_int) << 24) as isize as usize[0m) in both the main loop and the fallthrough tail; "fixing" it would change every hash of data with a high bit in byte 3 or 7.[0m[0m
- The C [38;5;10mswitch[0m fallthrough tail is translated to descending [38;5;10mif rem >= k[0m guards, which is equivalent.[0m[0m
- [38;5;10mstbds_load_32_or_64[0m's shift dance, the [38;5;10mhash ^= hash ^ ROTR(...)[0m no-ops in [38;5;10mstbds_hash_string[0m, the global seed mutation inside [38;5;10mstbds_make_hash_index[0m, and the 64-byte [38;5;10mstorage[0m alignment are all preserved literally. [38;5;10mrealloc[0m/[38;5;10mfree[0m come from libc so allocations stay interchangeable with C callers.[0m[0m
- [38;5;10m#[repr(C)][0m layouts are pinned by a unit test against sizes/offsets measured from a C probe ([38;5;10marray_header[0m 32, [38;5;10mstring_block[0m 16, [38;5;10mstring_arena[0m 24, [38;5;10mhash_bucket[0m 128, [38;5;10mhash_index[0m 104 with [38;5;10mstring[0m at 72, [38;5;10mstorage[0m at 96).[0m[0m
